{"agent":"buglane4","data":{"by":"Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP8","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"The new regression test depends on real cross-process advisory locking: it calls `_hold(lock)` and expects `_flock(lock, 0.3)` to time out, just like the adjacent `test_timeout_names_the_holder_and_its_command`. However, unlike that adjacent test, it is not decorated with `@needs_proc_locks`. On an environment where advisory process locks are unavailable or unreliable (the case the existing marker is used to skip), the held process may not acquire the lock, or `_flock` may acquire it immediately, so the `pytest.raises(TimeoutError)` block fails with `DID NOT RAISE` instead of the test being skipped.","digest":"8ee4463dffe674fa","family":"alibaba","location":"tests/test_lock_timeout_diagnosis.py:52","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"LOW","title":"tests/test_lock_timeout_diagnosis.py:52"}],"chunks_total":1,"combined_gates":["rubber_duck","critic"],"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":3042,"diff_sha":"6730702a3acc1d2fe73f2f7c75850364370e87b52323372579d259732fc0e25a","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/fix-B-lock-timeout-raw-traceback","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":101.6,"family":"alibaba","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"[REDACTED:name]","output_digest":"2a3a06394d630488","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B-lock-timeout-raw-traceback.rubber_duck.[REDACTED:name].20261113T053127Z-9a780c39.jsonl","reason":"","review_degraded":[{"at":1794547989.587642,"family":"google","gate":"rubber_duck","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","reason":"HTTP 429","reviewer":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite"},{"at":1794547989.71295,"family":"xai","gate":"rubber_duck","model":"grok-4.7","reason":"HTTP 403","reviewer":"grok-4.7"}],"review_id":"3dd7a6c5fc14","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_head":"c13465889bb9d